cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "AI Visibility Index for Trading Brands"
abstract: >-
  A quarterly measurement of what AI assistants tell traders about forex and
  CFD brokers, prop trading firms and crypto exchanges. ChatGPT, Claude,
  Gemini, Perplexity and Google are asked fixed questions in many markets, and
  every brand they name gets an AI Visibility Score from 0 to 100, by market
  and by source.
